{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは🌙\n櫻坂46四期生の勝又春です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミーグリありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "数ヶ月ぶりのリアルミーグリ、\nそして初めて4部とサイン会全てに参加ということで、今でも余韻に浸っちゃうくらいすごく楽しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらは幕張🧶"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobr3PTMT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobMCSBNy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJbnNgw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたにしか言えないこと、\nあなたにしか共有できない思い、感情、時間がたくさんあって、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会うと、つい笑顔になれる！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話して、聞いて、よりお互いを知っていけるこの時間が大好きで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ、\n終わったあとは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し寂しくもなっちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じ気持ちかな？、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また会える日まで頑張るね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobMtwdU9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後半はカチューシャ付けたりもした！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都はね、\n地元ということで\n少し珍しい赤？ワインレッド？のお洋服を着てみたよ〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrxHTLQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結構はっきりした色だったから、\n移動中は上着を羽織って隠してたりもして、\nちょっとそわそわしてたんだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん褒めてもらえて嬉しかったー！❤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人っぽいって言ってくれてありがとう🫣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして祝花もありがとうございます！💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幕張でいただいたお花"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobDn8Pzu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都でいただいたお花"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobv6tTks.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すべて\n思いを込めてくださったのが伝わってきて、\n幸せな気持ち満タンです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとね！！！\nこの2日間のリアミで、\n初めてその場面を見て、嬉しかったことがあって。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サイン会の時に自分のレーンに並んでる方同士が、前後で少しお話しされてる様子を偶然見かけたの！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じ時間を楽しんでくださっている方同士で\n自然と会話が生まれているのを見て、\nなんだかすごく嬉しくなりました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私をきっかけに、\n少しでも人との繋がりや輪が広がっていたら💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなでも楽しんでいけたら嬉しいな🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "____"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後に、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨晩の「くりぃむクイズ ミラクル9」\n今朝の「ラヴィット！」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観てくださった方、用事があって心の中で応援してくださった方、みなさんありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「くりぃむクイズ ミラクル9」は2度目ということで、またこうして呼んでいただけてすごく嬉しかったです！\n次こそ勝ちたい！！🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ラヴィット！」は登場シーンで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "内股外股勝又をやろうとして足が全く写らず"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "謎にちょい横移動した人になったのは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二人だけの秘密ね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#31"}], "source": "official"}